From 1ba80db215a5b3a857d715e44cb3b51c0b252fdd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ekaunt <ekaunt@maany.cloud>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 02:31:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] callbetter.com look: tron_cb_grid, tron_cb_border, cb
 wipe

Port of the callbetter.com landing page (public/lp.html): starfield and
glows on #04060f, 48px cyan grid masked to an ellipse with one light
cycle at a time and a build-in from the centre; panel-style focus border
with corner brackets and a one-shot trace on focus change; windows wipe
in from the left behind a scan line. View fx redraw extended to 0.8 s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
